		{"id":"c87c9f140b7e7775","x":-100,"y":-265,"width":250,"height":90,"type":"text","text":"During one of her walks in the forest, Tullia believes to hear a dolphin"},
		{"id":"27178bfceda7431e","x":-466,"y":-260,"width":250,"height":80,"type":"text","text":"Oliver shares to Cat he heard Dolphin near the coast"},
		{"id":"7f2a4894b42a66f0","x":-200,"y":-250,"width":80,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"OR"},
		{"id":"17e8998e3f089838","x":-285,"y":-160,"width":250,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"Cat recruits Leo and Tullia to come with explore -> by boat or land? Sammy stays behind. He is the only one who knows what they are up to. Cat only tells her dad they'll be out for the day. "},
		{"id":"a41c5b1bb5c1b65e","x":-285,"y":40,"width":250,"height":100,"type":"text","text":"They pass by Camie's bakery to gather some goods without telling her where they're going."},
		{"id":"24ceeba436f474fd","x":-285,"y":160,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"They leave in the morning to go investigate the sounds. "},
		{"id":"57b7de120b4ce621","x":-285,"y":-405,"width":250,"height":120,"type":"text","text":"Kids are planning smth: show Francois that he's wrong, that Finn is good and well"},
		{"id":"0b21d1ec4500f38a","x":-516,"y":245,"width":250,"height":115,"type":"text","text":"They go by boat following the coast and end up on a different part of the island"},
